{
  "id": 8867179757767,
  "title": "Personalized Baseball Bedding Full Size Flag Custom Name D - Design 12",
  "handle": "personalized-baseball-bedding-full-size-flag-custom-name-d-design-12",
  "body_html": "<p>At Jeminise, we understand the passion for baseball, and this Comforter Set is designed for every baseball player, fan, and lover. It offers a cozy retreat with a personalized touch, making it a thoughtful gift for any occasion.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Meaningful Gift:</strong> Celebrate determination and love for baseball with a bedding set that speaks volumes.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Offered in US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), and US King (104\" x 88\").</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Superior Manufacturing:</strong> Features environmental protection techniques to prevent fading and ensure smooth, fine, and compact stitching for lasting enjoyment.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Soft &amp; Comfy Material:</strong> Made from 100% Brushed Polyester Fabric with Whole-Piece Microfiber Filling for softness, comfort, durability, and lightweight feel.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water, dries quickly, and maintains fluffiness. It's recommended to wash in a mesh laundry bag.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Custom Options:</strong> Personalize with custom name text inputs, making it a unique gift for men, women, moms, dads, and more.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Versatile Use:</strong> Perfect for all seasons, offering breathable comfort year-round.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Duvet Cover Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester, Cotton</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Baseball Thunder</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Baseball</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Design</th>\n<td>Personalized Baseball Bedding Set</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Included Components</th>\n<td>Duvet Cover</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Customization</th>\n<td>2 text inputs</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Available Sizes</th>\n<td>US Twin (68\" x 88\"), US Full (78\" x 88\"), US Queen (88\" x 88\"), US King (104\" x 88\")</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Selected Size</th>\n<td>Multiple Size</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Special Feature</th>\n<td>Breathable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Closure Type</th>\n<td>Zipper</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Thread Count</th>\n<td>400</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
